cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Text-as-Data Analysis of Swedish Risk & Vulnerability Analyses"
authors:
  - family-names: Selimovic
    given-names: Theodor
    email: theoselimovic@gmail.com
    affiliation: Sciences Po Paris
abstract: >-
  Text-as-data analysis of Swedish municipal Risk & Vulnerability Analyses (RSA)
  to study why risk governance has been increasingly adopted by municipalities
  and why security is treated as risk. Combines bag-of-words analysis with
  Sentence-BERT semantic similarity to measure institutional isomorphism.
keywords:
  - risk governance
  - text-as-data
  - Swedish municipalities
  - institutional isomorphism
  - BERT
  - natural language processing
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/theodorselimovic/Text-as-data-master-thesis-repo
date-released: 2025-01-01
